
<p>Hello, my name is GIGA like gigabyte. ANDROGENFEED is a combo hub for both my personal site as well as my web project, an ftm archive for resources and stories. Both heavily center around the musings of a queer/trans artist. Currently I am working on providing helpful information with this site. I also plan on regularly updating the aesthetics and functionality of both the personal and project focused parts of the site. I have autism and ADHD, and currently this site is a huge area of focus for me.</p>
